        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia #43 Sleek Designer Stainless Steel Lever with Mortise Box</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Omnia #43 Sleek Designer Stainless Steel Lever has a mortise box for the smoothest operation available. It is available with 2-3/4 inch or 2-1/2 inch backsets. The Omnia 2000 Series Sectional Trim Mortise Lockset with #43 Lever has a brushed stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia #43 Sleek Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking. </li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
